{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "name": "all-agents-round-robin-quick-v1",
  "description": "Every currently functional agent against every other once (13 agents, 78 comparisons) at smoke scale: 64 duplicate deals per comparison (seed 20261201), 16 samples for every PIMC agent. Intervals are wide at this size; for conclusions copy this file, raise \"deals\" to 1024 and change name and output_root (roughly 10+ hours, mostly the model-guided PIMC comparisons). Needs the study, pilot and P5 checkpoints under runs/. Not included: model-guided PIMC with a value leaf (measured weaker, and --pimc-leaf is a run-level setting, so it cannot meet full-rollout model-guided PIMC in one comparison).",
